    "env_entry": {
      "metadata": {
        "description": "One applied durable environment change of an env step (PROP-065#env-step), removed exactly by uninstall and modify. `previous` / `previousKind` keep a Windows value the change replaced. A `path_prepend` replaces nothing, so it carries no `previous`; its `previousKind` is present exactly when the variable existed before vibe prepended, which is how removal tells a value vibe created (deleted with its last entry) from one that was already there (PROP-059#path-directories).",
